contentText:
Spotify&#8217;s total 777 million monthly average users generated 14% revenue growth of 4.777 million euros ($5.546 billion), in line with earlier guidance. The streamer beat guidance on its all-important gross margin, which expanded by 193 basis points to 33.4%, and on operating income, which totaled 655 million euros ($748 million).

